---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Vinula Kasthuriarachchi"
  description="Cybersecurity graduate portfolio of Vinula Kasthuriarachchi, focused on security operations, infrastructure security, cyber risk, governance, and practical cybersecurity uplift work."
>

<section class="hero-container">
  <img
    src="/images/profile/profile.jpeg"
    alt="Vinula Kasthuriarachchi"
    class="hero-image"
  />

  <div class="hero-text">
    <h1>Vinula Kasthuriarachchi</h1>

    <p class="subtitle">Cybersecurity Graduate</p>

    <ul class="hero-focus-list" aria-label="Portfolio focus areas">
      <li>Infrastructure Security</li>
      <li>Security Operations</li>
      <li>Cyber Risk & Governance</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Currently supporting a real-world cybersecurity uplift program at the National Railway Museum, focusing on network security, governance, and infrastructure protection.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a
        href="/Vinula_Kasthuriarachchi_Resume.pdf"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
        download="Vinula_Kasthuriarachchi_Resume.pdf"
        data-open-and-download
        class="btn btn-primary"
      >
        Download Resume
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-panel">
  <h2>About Me</h2>

  <p>
    Cybersecurity graduate with a Master of Information Technology
    (Cyber Security) from the University of South Australia and a
    background in Software Engineering.
  </p>

  <p>
    My experience includes cybersecurity assessment, network
    segmentation planning, governance development, identity and
    access management, infrastructure security review, and security
    awareness initiatives.
  </p>

  <p>
    I am currently contributing to the National Railway Museum's
    cybersecurity improvement program while continuing to develop
    practical experience in security operations, infrastructure
    security, and cyber governance.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="feature-card">
  <h2>Featured Project</h2>

  <h3>National Railway Museum Cybersecurity Uplift Program</h3>

  <p>
    Real-world cybersecurity uplift initiative covering infrastructure
    analysis, network segmentation, governance development, MFA
    assessment, and stakeholder engagement.
  </p>

  <a href="/projects/nrm" class="btn btn-secondary">View Project</a>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Core Skills</h2>

  <p class="section-intro">
    Practical skills I use across cybersecurity assessment, infrastructure review, and governance work.
  </p>

  <ul class="skill-list">
    <li>NIST CSF</li>
    <li>Network Security</li>
    <li>Identity & Access Management</li>
    <li>Risk Assessment</li>
    <li>Cyber Governance</li>
    <li>MFA Implementation</li>
    <li>Infrastructure Security</li>
    <li>Security Awareness</li>
  </ul>
</section>

</MainLayout>
